		<item>
			<title>Procedure</title>
			<link>https://www.learningtreechennai.com/admissions/procedure</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.learningtreechennai.com/admissions/procedure</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<p style="text-align: justify;">These are the steps to securing your child's admission at Learning Tree:<br /><br />Collect the Admission Application Form from the school OR download it from this site<br /><br />Fill in the Admission Application Form<br /><br />Submit the Form at the school office, at which time you will be given an appointment for a meeting with the Principal<br /><br />Meet the Principal with your child at the appointed date and time, along with your child's Birth Certificate. If your child has attended another school previously, bring the child's Progress Report and other relevant records.<br /><br />Once you have been notified that your child had secured admission, pay the required amount towards the Admission Fees and the Term Fees<br /><br />Attend the New Parent Orientation Session on the date/time intimated</p>]]></description>
			<category>Admissions</category>
			<pubDate>Thu, 03 Nov 2016 12:36:30 +0530</pubDate>
		</item>
