			<link>https://www.learningtreechennai.com/admissions</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.learningtreechennai.com/admissions</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<p style="text-align: justify;"><br />Admissions happen thrice a year for the primary age group for the term beginning June, September and January. Please apply anytime of the year to meet the team to understand about the Montessori Method and the School. If there is a vacancy for the following term, we will reach out to you.</p>]]></description>
